00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:25.690
<v Ira Glass>So suddenly, single at 31, time clock ticking, where do you start?
<v Ira Glass>那么，31岁突然单身，时间钟在滴答作响，你从哪里开始？

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:46.710
<v Ira Glass>Well, Kurt called this woman that he knew just a little bit and had a date on the very first or second night. He can't remember which it was. And at dinner, he told her the entire situation. He laid the whole thing out, that he was seeing somebody, they were taking this break to sleep around. And this was a rule that he made for himself, that he was always going to be honest with any woman that he met during this month. He was going to be honest up front.
