00:10:46.710 --> 00:11:01.660
<v Kurt Braunohler>And that's the weird thing. That's the thing that I still, kind of when I think back on this time, that I don't understand. Like I don't understand how these women that I met during that time heard this story and were like, OK, let's continue with this date.
<v Kurt Braunohler>这就是最奇怪的地方。即便到现在回想起这段时间，我还是不明白。我不明白这些我当时见到的女人听了这个故事后，为什么会说：“好吧，让我们继续这次约会吧。”

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:02.970
