00:30:10.720 --> 00:30:35.080
<v Robbie Brown>I interviewed the undercover officer who played Naomi. She's a 25-year-old new recruit with the Palm Beach School's police force. She wouldn't give me her real name, and only agreed to a phone interview if her supervising sergeant could listen in. She wouldn't talk to me about any specific cases, or kids at the school, including Justin. But she did confirm that she was asked to prom. She doesn't remember it quite the way Justin does though. Mainly, she says she didn't say yes.
<v Robbie Brown>我采访了那位扮演娜奥米的卧底警官。她是一名25岁的棕榈滩学校警察部队的新兵。她没有告诉我她的真实姓名，并且只有在她的监管中士旁听的情况下才同意电话采访。她没有和我谈论任何具体案件，或者学校里的孩子，包括贾斯汀。但她确实确认她被邀请去舞会了。不过，她记得的情况和贾斯汀的不太一样。主要是，她说她并没有答应。

00:30:35.080 --> 00:30:57.790
<v Naomi>I told him I wasn't going just because, since this is not where I spent the last three years of high school, I didn't really want to go to the prom. And I had to pay for the ticket and everything else. I was like, no, it's too much money for me. And he bought it.
