<v Justin>I'm thinking, what the heck am I doing? Like I had never done this in the school before. So I'm really scared and skeptical about it, too, at the same point. And I'm like, oh, man. OK. So I'm asking my home boy. And my friend is like, no-- I don't know. Because I don't hang out with guys like that.
<v Justin>我在想：“我到底在做什么？”我以前从没在学校里干过这种事。所以我当时也很害怕和怀疑。我心想：“哦，天哪。好吧。”所以我去问我的哥们。我的朋友说：“不——我不知道。”因为我不和那样的人混在一起。

